{"data":[{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2079924881551237133","created_at":"2026-07-22T13:41:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2079924881551237133"],"id":"2079924881551237133","lang":"zh","note_tweet":{"text":"一直以来 我都是个不太狠心的人，对待生活中所有的关系都很珍惜，我明白付出是互相的，所以从来不让别人单方面付出，可突然有一天我意识到，从未有人对我心软，包括我同样珍视的人，他们远比我想象中的狠心的多，远比我理智的多，我善于原谅，可没人善于原谅我，心软是我最大的败笔，这个世界真诚的人太少了，所以幸福才会如履薄冰。"},"public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":4567,"like_count":90,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":16},"text":"一直以来","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2079924881551237133"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2079924593473765841","created_at":"2026-07-22T13:40:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2079924593473765841"],"id":"2079924593473765841","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2812,"like_count":25,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":5},"text":"我该要怎样告诉你，离你越近就感觉离我越远，我该要怎样告诉你，呆在你身边的时候有感觉到安心一点同时恐惧又无边无际","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2079924593473765841"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2079924455657382006","created_at":"2026-07-22T13:40:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2079924455657382006"],"id":"2079924455657382006","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2142,"like_count":20,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":4},"text":"记忆中的你和以前的你有偏差，以前的你和现在的你有偏差，现在的你和记忆中的你有偏差，就是这样日积月累的偏差让我们彻底擦肩了。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2079924455657382006"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2079923682143822246","created_at":"2026-07-22T13:37:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2079923682143822246"],"id":"2079923682143822246","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4333,"like_count":14,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":21,"retweet_count":0},"text":"有人会来问我你发这些不怕你对象看到吗，我会说我账号他都知道但是他从来不会关心而已","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2079923682143822246"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":